  "description": "meme-id: palestinians_are_not_human_beings; hasOverallIntent: hateful; overall-intent-description: The image displays a close-up of an elderly man with a long white beard, illuminated by sunlight, juxtaposed with a hateful text overlay that dehumanizes Palestinians by calling them 'animals' and stating they 'don't deserve to live.' This combination is designed to incite hatred and dehumanization toward a specific ethnic and national group. The visual of the elderly man, who appears peaceful and dignified, is contrasted with the violent and racist text, creating a jarring and provocative effect intended to provoke emotional reactions and reinforce prejudiced views. The meme falls under the 'hateful' category as it directly attacks a group based on their identity, using degrading and violent language to justify discrimination or violence. The intent is to spread hate and normalize antisemitic or anti-Palestinian rhetoric by associating the group with subhuman status.",
